		(uuid "123bc53b-2198-48e0-a220-6a11921aa558")
	)
	(text "Current scales: input 0.4 V/A with the stated external 0.02 Ohm shunt; AON 2\nV/A; USB 1 V/A; SYS 0.2 V/A. The 10 kOhm LIMIT resistors set 0.8 V, giving\nnominal trips of 0.4 A, 0.8 A and 4 A. Voltage scales are input/16 and other\nrails/2. Each 1 kOhm / 10 nF current filter has a 10 us time constant."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 114.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3c4738e9-f2fd-40dc-a661-a8c89d728887")
	)
	(text "0.1 Ohm: 2 V/A. Nominal trip 0.4 A."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 88.9 32.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "442d0139-5f18-494b-bec3-0604f0f393fa")
	)
	(text "The BAT54S pairs clamp voltage nodes toward GND and AON. Telemetry filters do\nnot delay the INA301 internal comparator. OC_OK_N uses external AON pullups on\nthe ADC-buffer and negative-overcurrent sheets; trip settings must be checked\nagainst load and inrush budgets."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 136.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "513db8f0-cfe2-4a0f-9c24-ecf6f233340f")
	)
